name newcommand
category Package
revision 18704
shortdesc Generate new LaTeX command definitions
relocated 1
longdesc Generating any other than the simple \newcommand-style
longdesc commands, in LaTeX, is tedious (in the least). This script
longdesc allows the specification of commands in a 'natural' style; the
longdesc script then generates macros to define the command.
